# JIRA READ — MCP THEN REST [CRITICAL]

## Rule JIRA.1

Prefer Jira MCP. After 2–3 retries with backoff on failure, use REST:

- Script: `config/scripts/get-jira-issue-rest.ps1`
- Credentials from `.env`: `JIRA_EMAIL`, `JIRA_API_TOKEN`, `JIRA_BASE_URL`
- Disclose: `Jira source: REST fallback (MCP unavailable or failed after retries).`

READ-ONLY unless a separate user-approved write workflow applies.
